#: ../../../reference/programs-to-try.rst:5
msgid ""
"Applications worth trying with ``pipx run``, which fetches the package into "
"a temporary environment and runs it without installing. Add ``--help`` on "
"first use so an unfamiliar tool does not act unexpectedly. Swap ``run`` for "
"``install`` to keep any of them on your ``PATH``."
